// Eraser diagram type: Flow Chart
direction down
colorMode pastel
styleMode shadow
typeface clean

Job received [shape: oval, icon: play, color: green]
Open CSV as a stream [icon: file-text]
Skip rows up to checkpoint_row [icon: skip-forward]
Take next 10k rows [icon: layers]
Keep only mapped columns [icon: filter]
Split chunk across process pool [icon: cpu]

Per row validation [icon: check-circle, color: blue] {
  Next phone column by priority [icon: list]
  Value empty [shape: diamond]
  Excel scientific notation [shape: diamond]
  Strip non digits [icon: scissors]
  Fast regex matches India mobile [shape: diamond, icon: zap]
  phonenumbers says valid [shape: diamond, icon: search]
  Landline and rule enabled [shape: diamond, icon: phone-off]
  Remember first reason [icon: bookmark]
  More phone columns [shape: diamond]
  Valid E164 number [shape: oval, icon: check, color: green]
  Rejected with reason [shape: oval, icon: x, color: red]
}

Valid rows batch [icon: check-square, color: green]
Rejected rows batch [icon: x-square, color: red]
Save chunk in one transaction [icon: database, color: purple]
More rows in file [shape: diamond]
Mark import done [shape: oval, icon: flag, color: green]

Job received > Open CSV as a stream
Open CSV as a stream > Skip rows up to checkpoint_row
Skip rows up to checkpoint_row > Take next 10k rows
Take next 10k rows > Keep only mapped columns
Keep only mapped columns > Split chunk across process pool
Split chunk across process pool > Next phone column by priority
Next phone column by priority > Value empty
Value empty > More phone columns: yes
Value empty > Excel scientific notation: no
Excel scientific notation > Remember first reason: yes sci_notation
Excel scientific notation > Strip non digits: no
Strip non digits > Fast regex matches India mobile
Fast regex matches India mobile > Landline and rule enabled: yes about 90 percent
Fast regex matches India mobile > phonenumbers says valid: no
phonenumbers says valid > Landline and rule enabled: yes
phonenumbers says valid > Remember first reason: no invalid
Landline and rule enabled > Remember first reason: yes landline
Landline and rule enabled > Valid E164 number: no
Remember first reason > More phone columns
More phone columns > Next phone column by priority: yes
More phone columns > Rejected with reason: no
Valid E164 number > Valid rows batch
Rejected with reason > Rejected rows batch
Valid rows batch > Save chunk in one transaction
Rejected rows batch > Save chunk in one transaction
Save chunk in one transaction > More rows in file
More rows in file > Take next 10k rows: yes
More rows in file > Mark import done: no
